  "notes": "16-seed no-cap Run 2 library declustering with stitched ttbar, built off ttHbb_run2_20261003_f7183e9-cca392c (its only upstream). D.1 rebuilds the splitting library with the ttbar subtraction by its FvT_ttHbb_stitched (same FvT in D.3); M.5 makes ttbar_PSData_stitched here from TTTo*_stitched (SubSampler, seed 5); D.4/D.5 against its B.1 noJCM histograms (processor_ttHbb, 4b data + TTTo*_stitched, blinded); D.5 SvB bootstrap with SvB_ttHbb_stitched (ps = ps_ttHbb). D.6 off. Handoffs: mixeddata_all_declib16st, synthetic_data_lib16st_{4b,multijet}, ttbar_PSData_stitched. Replaces the unsubmitted declib16st_run2_20261006_be7ca0b-5caa947 (libA library, inclusive PS). RESULT (2026-10-06, ~2h45m on cmslpc335): first pass exit 1 at 208/211 -- 6 D3_decluster failures (worker loss: dict-vs-tuple accumulator, missing chunk at merge, one KilledWorker) all recovered by snakemake retries; daemon peak ~4.6 GB, no OOM. HOT PATCH: D5_seed_study crashed on the ttHbb hist_cuts axes (pass_nSelJets_gt6, passLeptonVeto: 120 values vs 31 edges); declustered_seed_study.py from coffea4bees acf740d17 (sums every extra category axis) copied into the checkout, then resume (3/3 steps, exit 0). D.5 closure (16-seed mean) data/Bkg: presel 1.006 +- 0.002, SR 1.009 +- 0.003, SB 1.003 +- 0.003 (per year 0.986-1.020). STITCHED PS BIAS: pseudodata / tt 4b MC = 1.026 +- 0.008 (every year > 1; declib16nc inclusive 1.002): SubSampler keeps an event with probability = weight, so negative-genWeight events are never kept -- inclusive TT 0.45% negative (+0.9% yield), TTbb parts 2.7-4.6% negative (+5.7% 2L2Nu, +9.7% SL, +10% had; UL18 chunk0). Affects any stitched PS. Not fixed. SEED STUDY: same draw 3.6%, identical events 1.7%, single-candidate 0; N_eff SR lead mass ~12.5, SB ~4. SVB BOOTSTRAP (ps_ttHbb, SR 4b): N_eff pooled 3.67 (one-seed 1.10), rho 0.23 (ttHbb SR 146k ev/seed, lowest ps bin N_eff 2.3, ~7-9 above).",
